<section aria-labelledby="h-steps">
  <div class="opener"><h2 class="h2" id="h-steps">Start in three steps.</h2><p class="sub">All inside WordPress. No new app to learn.</p></div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div><span class="num">1</span><h3>Install Bridle.</h3><p>Free from WordPress.org. Use Bridle AI, or connect your own AI key.</p></div>
    <div><span class="num">2</span><h3>Forward your support email.</h3><p>Keep your address. Bridle gives you one to forward to, with steps for Gmail and Outlook.</p></div>
    <div><span class="num">3</span><h3>Turn on chat.</h3><p>One switch puts the chat bubble on your site.</p><a class="lnk" href="/chat/">See Bridle Chat ›</a></div>
  </div>
  <p class="note-line">Visitors load one small script, and only when chat is on. Replies are written in the background, never while a page loads.</p>
</section>
